  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[wdio-mocha-framework](https://www.npmjs.com/package/wdio-mocha-framework) just published its new version 0.4.4.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :warning:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      wdio-mocha-framework\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      0.4.4\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build kept failing**.\n\n**It looks like your project, in its current form, is malfunctioning** and this update didn’t really change that. I don’t want to leave you in the dark about updates though. I recommend you get your project passing and then check the impact of this update again.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 3 commits .\n- [`d3415cc`](https://github.com/webdriverio/wdio-mocha-framework/commit/d3415cce22f384de8925191841ab1e3f7b9f085a) <code>v0.4.4</code>\n- [`0cf9ba9`](https://github.com/webdriverio/wdio-mocha-framework/commit/0cf9ba9c7a852de93f7817b669a6bbcb06c0ccad) <code>fixed linting in test files</code>\n- [`b32ecdf`](https://github.com/webdriverio/wdio-mocha-framework/commit/b32ecdf2f4613521013b1e3ba864290fd5d9f30c) <code>bumped wdio-sync</code>\n\nSee the [full diff](https://github.com/webdriverio/wdio-mocha-framework/compare/a4fb588cf703eec98107411d9ccb0d05c4c32184...d3415cce22f384de8925191841ab1e3f7b9f085a).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
